{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"This is the Mender's cottage.  It is under the permanent effects of Private Sanctum.  Likewise the door is magically locked barring access to anyone that does not have permission to enter.  The inside of the cottage matches the outside, looking to be more grown than built.\n\nOn the left side of the door sitting on a small table is a book.  The first page of the book states:\n```Betraying the trust of this house, is betraying the trust of the owner.  Inform no soul of the things spoken in confidence here.  Please feel free to sign the guestbook```","created_at":"2021-07-08T18:42:26.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"862765593781600287","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(Player Note, this Channel is an IC channel, but is not tracked by the bot as such, so no one can ?where you and see it.  As a mender, you get access to a special bot command.  If you direct message ArcaniaBot -so not in the chats on the server- you can use a command ?encrypt or ?decrypt to make messages hard for others to decipher.  This is great for if you need to get messages to each other out in the open.  Make sure to copy-paste messages directly as typos will cause massive issues with decrypting in the end.  In addition, this group is so secret, even the other DM's don't know about it, so do not talk about it anywhere but here.  When in doubt, ooc me or radar here and ask.  Under no circumstance should you hashtag this location.)","created_at":"2021-07-08T19:00:38.086000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-08T19:06:06.041000Z","id":"862770170266910722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
