{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I mentioned the little trip we had to the Noir. When I asked what exactly our objective was at the time, I was told that for the time being it was just for the sake of hope, but there was a separate long-term goal. Finding Hampstead's cornerstone. I remember you mentioning these last time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T17:59:48.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867103517986127912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
