{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Each borough, and the city as a whole, has a cornerstone, placed by the Masons. Those are what protects the city from crazy magic stuff. It's because there's something wrong with them that we have the Noir in Kingsbridge and the bleeds in Ferrytown. And I'm guessing our problems with the magic taxes now might also be related.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:24:10.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789127012188192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Masons place the stones, Tinkers keep the stones from breaking. But now, there's also a need for Menders, to fix broken stuff.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:25:13.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789391938191371","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Fuddles nods \"I see and that's where we come in?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:25:51.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867789550806237276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Pretty much. Last time I went to the Noir with Sab, Apgan, and Johnathan, they mentioned someone going by 'Hope', who told them that there's a cornerstone in Hampstead, but for now we're not sure where it is, but there are still some rumors going around. So that's one thing I've been looking into. But then, you did see the note on the table.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:27:58.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867790084744544286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yes when I was in here getting the holy water.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:29:02.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867790353197170698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Ben Franklin is one of the Masons, but it's still us who need to do the fixing. It's after a talk with him that Mender went to get tools, and why we need to go to the old part of Hampstead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:29:27.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867790456422793227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So I thought best if we both go to check the Gazette. If you prefer to do it in your time later, no problem. I agree with Mender that we can't rush, but it's still something we can do now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:31:11.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867790890466541609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Just one thing to note, we're not supposed to discuss things from the cottage outside, and that's why we're here now. And as of now, Sab does not know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:32:34.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867791241231073280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yes. Now would be best. Understood. \"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:33:05.152000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867791368994553926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Alright. I need to get my ship from Kingsbridge, I'll join you at the port. Sab will probably want to tag along, and she might be helpful, but let's keep the mission to ourselves for now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:34:54.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867791829255323678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"And let's hope we can make a difference.\" Roy exits the cottage.","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:35:16.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867791920419700746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Fuddles nods and leaves aswell","created_at":"2021-07-22T15:36:40.333000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867792271527903243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"The mender enters, calmly setting out paper and quill.  He sets a Diamond Sciber on the center of the table.","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:49:46.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868173055598411806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Roy slowly enters the cottage, and closes the door after Fuddles follows him. \"Hello, Mender? We've heard this might not be the best time, but wanted to meet with you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:19:50.898000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868180624505180273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Oh no this is a great time... tho I may have overdone the theatrics.... also... bo is not going to be joining us\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:20:32.490000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868180798954684517","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Oh that's a shame. I thought he would have fit in well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:21:06.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868180940072046602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"That's unfortunate. Is it because of his new friend?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:21:18.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868180989946523748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yes... but his ties to that entity... make me uncomfortable...\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:21:27.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868181027644932166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"The 'r' might be silent there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:21:27.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868181029091950663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"yes.... also I would suggest avoiding saying his name\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:22:21.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868181256855224330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yeah, there seems to be a bit of a rumble when that happens. But before we talk about anything specific, not sure if you've heard from Sab that everyone over at the Golden Voice started feeling like something is watching them, around noon. Does this place protect us from something like that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:24:12.311000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868181720950779905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"This house is protected from all forms of scrying and divination, that only a deity might be able to see through.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:25:27.640000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T17:25:33.233000Z","id":"868182036903522395","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Beyond these walls.... no such protection\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:25:44.677000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182108361859072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"That should be enough for now, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:26:42.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182351040094258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So what did you discover about the stone of Hampstead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:27:33.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182566518292580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Out of mundane things, it really needed some cleaning. The fog rolled in soon after we got there, but I got the inscription from it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:28:31.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182809309745212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Fear of loss drives all strife.\"\n\"Truth is the only path to liberty.\"\n\"Let Justice and Mercy be equal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:29:08.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868182961722384464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"He nods \"Fuddles... roy.... those are the founding principals of this city.... what do you make of them?  Have thy held up?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:29:49.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868183137098793060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Hmm this is interesting. This is the first I am hearing these. I got delayed when we were heading to check it out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:31:31.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868183561587523614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yeah, we wanted to all go, but had to split. Sab was with me at the stone, but I covered up the task with that story about looking for a place for a new park in hampstead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:32:39.364000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868183847685218434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he nods and picks up the Diamond Sciber","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:33:56.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868184170445307955","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Which, I still think it would be nice to have places like this in the other boroughs. Though it still was a bit against that second principle. I wish we could involve our allies more, but I'm sure you have a reason.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:34:33.880000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868184328000143420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Fear of loss drives all strife. It does feel like that's accurate. People here don't want to lose their freedom. The British don't want to lose the wealth and power that comes from here. So we have this conflict.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:36:07.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868184720620540004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"64bbbd2950344977908eae5f5409c157.png","id":"868184977953652776","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/860165485579337779/868184977953652776-64bbbd2950344977908eae5f5409c157.png","message_id":"868184978146611210","sha256":"1dc2301d30b01edb1fead2f68b35b0fcbcb809573750ce50ac2b05ad551f42cb","size":128145,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/860165485579337779/868184977953652776/64bbbd2950344977908eae5f5409c157.png?ex=6ac09484&is=6abf4304&hm=cf00fd070931e646627a73613b10a76aa180a08a6eafe49122cd6b0938839008&"}],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he nods \"We will find more.... but if someone got their hands on this\" and he shows the scriber \"they could write death and desolation into the fabric of a city... the less people that know of a thing.... the less can use if you ill\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:37:08.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868184978146611210","reply_to_id":"868184328000143420","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Fuddles... would you say that fear and loss are overtaking truth, justice, and mercy?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:38:11.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868185239879557191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yes. People lean more on the side of fear and loss because they fear those with power will take the things they hold most dear. Freedom and life. I hate to say it but there is not many we can trust with this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:43:41.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868186623282663505","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"since those words are failing us.... what principals... what words.... would stabilize this city.... justice, truth, and mercy aren't enough\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:45:10.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868186998794489906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he looks at the both of you","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:45:26.355000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868187064678613013","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Love...Family. To me those words are stronger then any other.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:47:36.015000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T17:48:44.080000Z","id":"868187608512098425","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Hope, maybe? Some of our friends are already fighting following hope.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:47:53.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868187680641536050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Unity? We all have things that make us different, but overall we still all work towards one and the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:48:51.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868187926075420752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yes Unity! You can't divide very easy something that is One.!\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:50:13.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868188267244318720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So we are in dark times.... and be indivisable... we need love and family..... to vanquish the darkness.... the light of hope....\" he shakes his head \"too much... too many words... but all is needed\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:51:33.674000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868188605326180453","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"If you base Unity off of family, Love and Hope. It is very hard to break.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:53:30.986000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T17:53:49.452000Z","id":"868189097368379442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"With love and hope, family stays as one? Now I can see why you're the one running the Golden Voice.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:55:20.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868189555734499388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"United We Stand. Now and forever. \"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:56:54.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868189949743222794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Within Love and hope\nthe bond of family is found\nthat no darkness can divide\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:57:45.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868190163577217025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"how does that sound?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:57:53.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868190198293479494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
