{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he sets the Scriber on the table \"I cannot be the one to write these words.... Love is hopelessness to me.... and I betrayed the only family I have ever had....\" he looks sad at these words \"the intent behind the carving is as important as the words themselves.  One of you must borrow this scriber and put the words on the stone in the park.  But be careful... .It can etch words on anything it wishes... and imbue the intent into the object.... so only use it on the stone.... which of you feels they can write those words from their heart and mean them?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:01:42.387000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T18:02:52.860000Z","id":"868191158453534740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I believe those words. And in a way, I represent some form of unity. But Fuddles, everyone on the Voice holds you in very high regard. I think you might be who really makes its crew a family. I think you embody the idea more than I do. I'll provide all the support I can along the way and let you be the person to do it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:06:56.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868192473917300836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Fuddles looks at Roy and The Mender \"I never thought I would find family again.\" She nods \"Yes I can do it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:12:11.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868193795471212574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"he motions for fuddles to pick up the Scriber \"Let us head out to the block of granite, and let you write the words that should last all of time.... afterwards please hand me my scriber back\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:13:13.611000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868194057657126993","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
